109	    <header class="page-header">
110	      <h1>Public Alert Styles</h1>
111	      <p>The <code>.ds-alert</code> status banner — success, info, warning, error/failure — rendered live from the public
112	      <code>design-system.css</code>. Every color in the table below is read from the stylesheet at runtime, so this page
113	      can't fall out of sync with the tokens.</p>
114	      <p class="mode-note">Light/dark follows your system setting — the alert tokens are the first dark-aware tokens on the
115	      public side, so switch your OS appearance and reload to preview dark.</p>
116	    </header>
117	
118	    <section class="section">
119	      <h2 class="section-title">Live examples</h2>
120	      <p class="section-desc">Rendered with the real <code>.ds-alert</code> classes. Each state pairs a distinct icon
121	      shape with a leading word, so it never relies on color alone (WCAG 1.4.1).</p>
122	
123	      <div class="live-demo">
124	        <div class="demo-stack">
125	
126	          <div class="ds-alert ds-alert-success" role="status">
127	            <svg class="ds-alert-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
128	            <div class="ds-alert-content">
129	              <p class="ds-alert-title">Preferences saved</p>
130	              <p>You'll get a weekly digest of new papers in your selected categories.</p>
131	            </div>
132	          </div>
133	
134	          <div class="ds-alert ds-alert-info" role="status">
135	            <svg class="ds-alert-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
136	            <div class="ds-alert-content">
137	              <p class="ds-alert-title">Viewing an older version</p>
138	              <p>This is version v1. A newer version exists — <a href="#">see the latest version</a>.</p>
139	            </div>
140	          </div>
141	
142	          <div class="ds-alert ds-alert-warning" role="alert">
143	            <svg class="ds-alert-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg>
144	            <div class="ds-alert-content">
145	              <p class="ds-alert-title">Withdrawn paper</p>
146	              <p>This submission was withdrawn by the authors and is shown for the historical record.</p>
147	            </div>
148	          </div>
