151	            <svg class="ds-alert-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m15 9-6 6"/><path d="m9 9 6 6"/></svg>
152	            <div class="ds-alert-content">
153	              <p class="ds-alert-title">Couldn't load the PDF</p>
154	              <p>The file failed to render. <a href="#">Try the HTML version</a> instead.</p>
155	            </div>
156	          </div>
